<title>USA: Corning sees Q3 in line with estimates.</title>
<headline>Corning sees Q3 in line with estimates.</headline>
<dateline>CORNING, N.Y. 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corning Inc said on Wednesday that it expects third-quarter results for continuing operations to be in line with analysts' expectations of $0.41 to $0.42 per share.</p>
<p>The company also said it will see an after-tax charge of $115 million in the quarter for discontinued operations related to its Health Care Services unit.</p>
</text>
